Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.99,0:00:14.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(634,508)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Victim Was a 36-Year-Old Maid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dragon's Dragon, is the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.23,0:00:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dragon's Dragon, is the last one.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.83,0:00:16.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(749,508)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Another Maid Feud?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.91,0:00:18.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(672,508)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}What Will Become of Akiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a long time for the Dragon's Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's a long time\Nfor a Dragon's Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.34,0:00:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Nagi, this is the\Nmaid who offed Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of my maids caught her sliming around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.78,0:00:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which cafe is she from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.38,0:00:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wuv Wuv Moonbeam,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:01:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the one that Ronco wiped out right\Nafter getting out of the slammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.38,0:01:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't owe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not your creature, nor\Nam I an axolotl either!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a friggin' black space bunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wuv Wuv Moonbeam is the\Nonly home I'll ever know!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you seeking revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.54,0:01:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey boss, should she\Nsleep with the fishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.50,0:01:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.74,0:01:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An enjoyable maid cafe, how funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.88,0:01:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can release her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, but boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.47,0:01:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me say it twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.70,0:01:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.06,0:01:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Squeak all you want, it'll do you no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.66,0:01:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a creature now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see you prove your worth. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time has come to go\Nfull bore on those swine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.66,0:01:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for an all-out war.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.46,0:01:49.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(882,220.67)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Final Episode
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.46,0:01:49.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(805,479.33)\fnPapyrus\fs60\c&H234DFA&}At Moe's End
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,damn maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.80,0:01:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really wish they wouldn't\Nuse the same funeral hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's another gang war casualty, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.98,0:02:10.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(902,389)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Memorial Service
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.98,0:02:10.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(941,464)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Venue for the
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.98,0:02:10.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(864,540)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Late Ranko Mannen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard this maid got out of\Nprison less than a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet she deserved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wish Akiba could be\Nrid of all these maid cafes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the police when you need them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.66,0:02:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.62,0:02:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never know what\Nthey'll do if they hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.56,0:02:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear the news\Nthat Ronco Manon's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what the porker\Ngets for getting cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A 36-year-old maid dying feels\Nlike the end of a bygone era.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.70,0:02:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.84,0:02:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn straight, bear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.52,0:02:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other swine will be quick to follow,\Nso she won't be alone for very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.46,0:02:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just goes to show you that\NAkiba needs more beef than pork.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, see ya. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.54,0:02:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me where I can find\Nthe maid who killed Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're that pig from Oinky Doon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.34,0:02:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who killed Ronko?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell should I fucking know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.52,0:02:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can tag your ear like\Nthe useless heifer you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.44,0:03:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about I give you a nose ring next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all right, just stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll talk, I'll talk, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The worthless scum that killed Ronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a maid that used to\Nwork at Baan Moonbeam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the head give the order?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.96,0:03:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I do know the head's rounding up soldiers\Nand weapons to crush the oinky-doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where is she right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.14,0:03:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think an underling maid\Nlike me would know that answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you go tell the other creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi Wahira is in mourning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell them I'm black pork now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.16,0:03:39.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(979,799)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}DORAMA
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.52,0:03:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know about the\Nmaid named Uzuko who used
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to work upstairs when it\Nwas the maid tea room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never heard of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to tell me where she lives now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the heck would I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.22,0:03:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then where do her parents live?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.78,0:04:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that Ronko's gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have some time, I'll\Ntell you a bit about the past.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.57,0:04:15.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(634,356)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}DORAMA
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.57,0:04:15.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(759,552.33)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Ramen
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was 20-something years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.46,0:04:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A maid named Michio brought an\Norphan named Uzuko home with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even as a kid, her eyes always\Nlooked starved for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was back when Michio\Nhad a steel grip and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.78,0:04:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was well known as a\Nwarmonger maid in Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She intended to raise\NUzuko as her successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it wasn't until Ronko joined\Nthe cafe that Michio changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.92,0:04:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Ronko's innocent\Nsincerity rubbed off on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.10,0:04:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Michio changed her policy to make the Maid
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tea House a cafe that\Ndidn't rely on violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A far cry from what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.72,0:04:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Uzuko,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.16,0:04:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as starved as she was, couldn't bear\Nto see Michio give up all the violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.52,0:05:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jisoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.74,0:05:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so Usoko arranged a hit\Non Michio and killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, sadly, Ronko's dead as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usoko has no place she can call home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I reckon she doesn't\Neven have an address.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I would know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She craves immense power because\Nshe's afraid of being all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.22,0:05:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that power is why she is all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a sad, foolish creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't intend to eat anything,\NI'm going to need you to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're not going to eat?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.29,0:05:52.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(633.34,949.34)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:06:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi, where have you been all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still wearing that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.64,0:06:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't even come to the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! What? Nagomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a chip, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The creatures are coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to need a lot of guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.70,0:06:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're just going to steal\Nthe cafe's money to buy weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.16,0:06:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have any time to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't get prepared\Nquick, they'll slaughter us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.28,0:06:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be calm right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all still maids, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just took out one of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.08,0:06:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they kill one of ours,\Nwe take out one of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what maids do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoya, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.84,0:06:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm gonna send as many\Ngoddamn creatures to hell as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.50,0:06:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'm gonna see Ronko\Nthere with a smile on my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nerula, please forgive\Nme for having to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I disappointed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.54,0:07:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.34,0:07:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure got me the\Nutter day, ugly pig face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you pigs can get off?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.28,0:07:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.90,0:07:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, have an otter one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.42,0:07:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And an otter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, are you satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that enough to satisfy you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die, pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this about...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.64,0:08:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this all what being a\Nmaid's about? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this threatening and beating and\Nkilling, is that really all the fun for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.64,0:08:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you find enjoyment in\Nmaking people scared of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's wrong with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the point of being a maid, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.42,0:08:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she must have snapped\Nfrom getting clobbered too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll enter right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's too many\Npeople around right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.46,0:08:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's only got a few\Ndays left to live anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.58,0:08:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't you mates?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.66,0:08:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's have some more fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.76,0:08:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can be mates together!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.00,0:08:47.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(523.67,394.33)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Akihabara
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.00,0:08:47.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(524.33,445)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Police
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.00,0:08:47.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(526.67,494.67)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Station
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She should have just thrown\Nthis shabby thing away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who keeps this kind of silly thing anyway?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.62,0:09:18.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(670.67,652)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}From the friendly baseball game
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.62,0:09:18.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(742,773.33)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}vs. the Axolotls
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.78,0:09:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this dirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, why would you want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at how awful I look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.16,0:09:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, she wants us\Nto raid the pigsty now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have the time to prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you seriously questioning\Nthe head's decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.26,0:09:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, I have no idea what\Nthe head is thinking nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ever since that Ronco\Nmaid got out of the joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She disowned the pigsty,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.16,0:10:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then took them back, and now she's trying\Nto crush those damn hogs once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not easy to cope with. True that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.56,0:10:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's time for Miss\NNoggy's reign to come to an end.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.67,0:10:10.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(126.33,688)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.13,0:10:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did you run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi, we're ready to stand up and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to avenge Ranko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take down as many of them as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's a war they want, let's\Ngrit our teeth and just go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.26,0:10:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first, I wasn't so sure\Nabout Ranko as a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She didn't have a heart,\Nshe looked dead serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she killed people on her first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.48,0:10:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, I understand that being\Na maid with Ronko was so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said that Oinky Doon was her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose this place either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.68,0:10:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my home too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the creatures are\Ncoming for us, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be a fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're creatures too, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you enjoy the way Oinky\NDoink is now, Shipon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.18,0:11:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are your masters feeling the\Nlove when they come home?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.60,0:11:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is your mouth turned upwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mouth is very sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.34,0:11:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's nothing we\Ncan do about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.62,0:11:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we can do anything we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we are maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have something in mind then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll spring a maid war on those bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moose Nagi, would you consider\Nexterminating the pigs at a later date?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.16,0:11:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't paid off the cops yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we cause much more bloodshed, a fair\Nnumber of maids will end up in the slammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We stick to the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.84,0:11:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mentioned that you want\Nto take part in the slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.22,0:11:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious? I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whittle Teddy here thinks you shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything were to\Nhappen, I couldn't bear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any maids who refuse to obey me will die.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.55,0:12:16.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(710,486)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}DORAMA
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.55,0:12:16.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(842.67,633.33)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Ramen
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.16,0:12:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Large ramen, extra veggies, topped\Nwith sauce and a load of garlic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six of them, please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make that seven, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.48,0:12:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogomi, let me have some\Nof that ramen, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want some of that ramen, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.14,0:12:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I have a slurp, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since\Nyou've been here, Uzuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.86,0:13:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.56,0:13:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.47,0:13:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about to slaughter the hogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better get lost. Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.34,0:13:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko still called you her sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.70,0:13:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.22,0:13:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wish you and Ronko could\Nhave had my ramen one life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dipping noodles are the\Nnew thing now, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.12,0:13:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn dipping noodles.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.43,0:13:45.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(562.67,712)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:13:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.18,0:14:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home to the pigsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pigsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I can't believe we have\Nso many mistresses here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.02,0:14:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a sweet, sweet surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you, like, super nervous\Nbecause we're crazy cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.90,0:14:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, mistresses, relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are lots of cute maids\Nhere at Oinky Doink Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.44,0:14:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cute maids?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.50,0:14:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've come to slaughter you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, Oinky Doon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, why not experience some\Nof our love here at Oinky Doon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.28,0:14:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shitting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.19,0:14:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome, mistresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.26,0:14:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today happens to be our big\Nbang lovey-dovey heart event.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any cute mistress with a gun will get\Nto enjoy all of our services for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.10,0:14:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's 26 of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.64,0:14:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Porky very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.72,0:14:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard her. Take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This here is our charming\Nbrick house where us
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.60,0:14:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cute little pigs live\Ncalled the Oinky Doink Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are here to become the finest\NIberico pork to feed our humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.80,0:14:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Us piglets have been waiting\Nto serve all of you mistresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:14:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oink!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.87,0:15:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry, jackass! Jackass?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no rabbits\Nor donkeys here, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a house of piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Nagi, I heard you were once\Na maid here in this very location.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.26,0:15:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty mistresses, allow me to\Nplease take your oinkters right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.76,0:15:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.94,0:15:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recommend the live\Npork-formance oinky-doink special.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.32,0:15:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get that for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.68,0:15:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But once the pork-formance\Nis over, you all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a very wise snout, mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.94,0:15:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch as they make this drink here extra\Ntasty with the health of a snort snort.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.96,0:15:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I say oinky smooch,\Nyou say snorty snort, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.88,0:15:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready and oinky smooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snort!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting embarrassed at a maid\Ncafe like this is not oink-ay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially you mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.66,0:15:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get that scowl off your\Nface. That's it! Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.27,0:15:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill her myself later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, oinky-doink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like you've given up being human.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.30,0:15:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.96,0:16:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky smooch?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snorty snorty. Doon smooch?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snorty snorty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky-doink, doink, doink!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.06,0:16:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you all, your drinks\Nare now so much tastier!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does this swill\Ntaste so good, damn it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you turn off the damn light?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.18,0:16:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this a freaking trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.54,0:16:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not going to take this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.42,0:16:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.40,0:16:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.56,0:16:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ham so much for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to see so many of you here\Nallowing us to entertain you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here to kill you,\Nyou bitch-ass porker!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.22,0:16:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, oinky-doink!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.18,0:16:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Nagomi, and I'm here\Nto sing just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.64,0:16:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sparkle with you to the prime.
Dialogue: 11,0:16:47.78,0:16:49.28,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Sparkly and cute to the prime!
Dialogue: 11,0:16:49.28,0:16:50.86,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Come to me I'm sublime!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to me I'm sublime!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.78,0:16:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super duper showtime. Understand.
Dialogue: 11,0:16:50.86,0:16:53.83,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Unprecedented showtime! Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a seat and listen.
Dialogue: 11,0:16:53.83,0:16:59.92,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}This is where my Cinderella story starts, right here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.42,0:16:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To my Cinderella story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If ever your soul is feeling worn out?
Dialogue: 11,0:17:01.92,0:17:04.34,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}If ever your soul is feeling worn out
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.26,0:17:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a lovely gift for you.
Dialogue: 11,0:17:04.34,0:17:07.09,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Let me give a present just for you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This beautiful smile.
Dialogue: 11,0:17:07.09,0:17:09.84,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}This lovely smile, and even those tears
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even these tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her sparkling love infused\Nin them all. Here you go.
Dialogue: 11,0:17:09.84,0:17:11.72,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}There's sparkly love infused in them all
Dialogue: 11,0:17:11.72,0:17:12.64,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She needs sharper moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need sharper moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch me, that part should\Ngo something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.40,0:17:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so very good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so lucky to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I'll be a wonderful\Nmaid like you someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silly, picky, tricky.
Dialogue: 11,0:17:29.82,0:17:32.57,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Contrary, tricky, that's how a girl's heart works!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.98,0:17:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how a girl's heart works.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.42,0:17:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's selfish, I'm so sorry.
