Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, Mistress Snog?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.20,0:19:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their applause means nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.76,0:19:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many things have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since I've arrived here in Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen maids who were terrifying die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've seen maids who\Nwere dear to me die as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone on all sides killed so\Nmany to avenge the maids who died.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.78,0:19:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't find that to be any fun at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.96,0:19:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should cute maids\Nhave to hit each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does using guns help spread more love?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.74,0:19:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't pull the\Ntrigger, then you get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.14,0:19:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A maid either takes or gets taken from.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.96,0:19:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to be strong in\Norder to survive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.58,0:19:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A maid's job is to serve others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.98,0:19:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a maid I respect once said,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.86,0:19:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky Doink Cafe is happy to\Nserve as a home to all masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.52,0:19:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, and welcome home, my mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:20:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is my home now? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starting today, this is your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.42,0:20:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut the sentimental crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, Maid ultimately ends up alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mistress, if you ever feel lonely, please\Ntry coming home to Oinky Doink Cafe again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.74,0:20:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you will make\Nyou feel the moi moi kyun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.80,0:20:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your name's Nagomi, right? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.40,0:20:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a shitty maid who doesn't even\Ncome close to being like Miss Michio.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, you're a maid\Nwho's exactly like Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.22,0:20:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, that's such an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.44,0:20:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Mistress, were you able\Nto enjoy Oinky Doink Cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.50,0:21:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
