Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.81,0:22:56.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(875.33,688.67)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}AKIHABARA
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.06,0:23:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You probably don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.76,0:23:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Akiba used to be a really rough\Nneighborhood, with gunfights and all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.14,0:23:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gunfights in the Akiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.34,0:23:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.34,0:23:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem possible, does it? Uh, no.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.58,0:23:17.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(632,636)\fnPapyrus\fs60}New Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.74,0:23:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, why this cafe in particular?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.26,0:23:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So as to see our favorite maid, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.58,0:23:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A favorite, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of maid is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.74,0:23:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A 36-year-old maid. What?\NShe's 36? Here she comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.12,0:23:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, and welcome home, cute master.

